comment {
  /etc/vpp/setup.gate -- VPP startup CLI for fleetnode IPSec concentrators.

  This file is executed as VPP CLI commands immediately after VPP starts
  (before the binary API socket accepts connections).  For fleetnode, all
  runtime configuration -- af_packet interface creation, VRF setup, and
  NAT table population -- is applied by ipsecnode (Increment 6d) via the
  binary API socket at /run/vpp/api.sock.

  Intentionally empty: no interface or NAT configuration here.
}
